      "markdownBody": "# CodeRabbit findings for PAN-5662 (PR #5664)\n\nCodeRabbit posted 5 inline finding(s). CodeRabbit is advisory: nothing waits for these,\nbut each one gets an answer, either a fix or a reply with your reason.\n\n- Thread 4677267278 · features/conversations.mdx:160 [Minor]: Explain the `$` gate in the `$HOME` example.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5664#discussion_r4677267278\n- Thread 4677267285 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/chat/ComposerPromptEditor.tsx:419 [Minor]: Validate the inserted slash, not another slash in the prompt.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5664#discussion_r4677267285\n- Thread 4677267296 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/chat/ComposerPromptEditor.tsx:519 [Minor]: Replace the complete mention token when the caret is inside it.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5664#discussion_r4677267296\n- Thread 4677267302 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/chat/TriggerMenu.tsx:159 [Minor]: Ignore composing key events before menu dispatch.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5664#discussion_r4677267302\n- Thread 4677267306 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/chat/useFileMentionItems.ts:50 [Minor]: Clear the retained rows when the query changes.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5664#discussion_r4677267306\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Read each thread (open its link, or the code at the path and line).\n2. If you agree with a finding, fix it.\n3. If you reject a finding, reply on its thread with your reason:\n   `gh api repos/eltmon/overdeck/pulls/5664/comments/<thread id>/replies -f body=\"<reason>\"`\n4. If you changed code: run the quality gates on what you touched, commit, push, then run `pan review request PAN-5662 -m \"CodeRabbit <thread ids>: <what you changed>\"`.\n   If you only replied, you are done.\n5. If PR #5664 has already merged when you read this, stop: after the merge Overdeck files a follow-up issue\n   for every thread with no reply, no later commit to its file, and no re-review request naming its thread id."
